{"product_id":"iqos-fiit-crisp","title":"IQOS Fiit - Crisp","description":"\u003cp\u003eIqos Fiit Crisp is a mild tobacco blend with refreshing menthol and citrus notes. Made for Lil Solid. Fully compatible with IQOS 3 Duo \u0026amp; earlier devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIQOS Fiit is the discovery of the real taste of tobacco and new sensations. Natural tobacco, processed and pressed under a special technology, provides taste and aroma when heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA special biopolymer film allows to maintain a comfortable level of temperature and humidity of the tobacco vapor generated when the tobacco is heated.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePrice is per carton and pack. 1 carton contains 10 packs x 20 sticks = 200 sticks. Similarly, 1 pack contains 20 sticks.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"1 PACK","offer_id":41710162542647,"sku":"Fiit Crisp - Pack","price":600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"CARTON","offer_id":41710162575415,"sku":"Fiit Crisp - Carton","price":5000.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/fiit-crisp-carton.jpg?v=1750031926","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-fiit-crisp","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




